Voting Unit (Unit A):
All full-time drivers, including drivers without fixed routes, mechanic and mechanic helper, employed by the Employer at its Miami, Ft. Lauderdale, West Palm Beach and Orlando, Florida facilities; 

All other employees, seasonal employees, professional employees, office employees, managers, guards and supervisors as defined in the Act 

The election will be conducted through the United States mail. Mail ballots will be deposited in the U.S. mail on December 1, 2005 and must be received at the Miami Resident Office by the close of business at 4:30 p.m. on December 15, 2005.  The mail ballot envelopes will be opened and counted on December 16, 2005 at 2:00 pm at the National Labor Relations Board, Region 12, Room 1320, 51 SW 1st Avenue, Miami, Florida.
